graph TB
    subgraph AIClaw["AIClaw Application"]
        JS["JS Layer Event Handler"]
        NAPI["NAPI Layer C++ Bridge"]
        Proxy["Client Proxy IPC Client"]
    end

    subgraph Service["CLI Manager Service SA 9001"]
        RPC["RPC Server"]
        ED["Event Dispatcher"]
        PM["Process Manager"]
        RM["Registry Manager"]
        IO["I/O Monitor epoll"]
    end

    subgraph Tool["CLI Tool Process"]
        EXE["CLI Executable"]
        OUT_P["stdout pipe"]
        ERR_P["stderr pipe"]
    end

    JS --> NAPI
    NAPI --> Proxy
    Proxy <-->|IPC Binder| RPC
    RPC --> ED
    RPC --> PM
    PM --> RM
    ED --> IO

    PM -->|spawn| EXE
    EXE --> OUT_P
    EXE --> ERR_P

    OUT_P -->|pipe read| IO
    ERR_P -->|pipe read| IO

    IO -->|OnReadable| ED
    ED -->|Callback| RPC
    RPC --> Proxy